---
import Starfield from './Starfield.astro';
---
<section class="future section-block" id="future-systems">
  <Starfield />
  <header class="section-heading reveal">
    <p class="section-label">Future R&amp;D</p>
    <div class="red-rule"></div>
    <h2>Space Technology<br />Under Development.</h2>
    <p>目前聚焦衛星熱管理與電子系統的電磁干擾防護</p>
  </header>

  <div class="future-grid">
    <article class="future-card reveal">
      <div class="future-card__visual">
        <img src="/media/future-satellite-thermal-simulation.png" alt="Numerical thermal simulation of a spacecraft electronics package and its heat-transfer path to a radiator" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="future-card__copy">
        <div class="roadmap-label">R&amp;D ROADMAP · UNDER DEVELOPMENT</div>
        <h3>Satellite Thermal Management</h3>
        <h4>衛星熱管理技術</h4>
        <p>研究衛星電子設備的熱路徑、散熱器配置與軌道環境下的溫度變化。</p>
        <ul><li>Orbital thermal-load analysis</li><li>Heat-pipe and thermal-strap design</li><li>Radiator sizing and placement</li><li>Temperature monitoring and control</li></ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="future-card reveal">
      <div class="future-card__visual">
        <img src="/media/future-spacecraft-emi-simulation.png" alt="Numerical electromagnetic simulation of a spacecraft electronics enclosure, connector, and shielding boundary" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="future-card__copy">
        <div class="roadmap-label">R&amp;D ROADMAP · UNDER DEVELOPMENT</div>
        <h3>Spacecraft EMI Protection</h3>
        <h4>太空電磁干擾防護技術</h4>
        <p>針對衛星電子模組在外太空環境中的電磁干擾，研究屏蔽、接地、濾波與封裝結構。</p>
        <ul><li>Shielding enclosure and partition design</li><li>Conductive gaskets and grounded interfaces</li><li>Filtered connectors and cable shielding</li><li>Packaging-level EMI verification</li></ul>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
  <p class="future-disclaimer reveal">以上項目仍在研發，尚未作為量產產品或商用服務對外供應。</p>
  <span class="section-number">04 / 06</span>
</section>
